Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Fix nested class bug and theme refresh issues in
 MainWindow, AnalyticsPage, and CourseDetailPage

- .gitignore: Simplified to only ignore *.db files
- src/ui/main_window.py: Removed duplicate nested MainWindow class causing AttributeError; fixed refresh_all_pages_theme logic; improved sync result notifications and RTL application timing
