- src/ui/pages/course_detail_page.py: Added missing refresh_theme method to handle tab styling and hero card re-rendering on theme change; fixed opacity animation bug affecting Hero visibility in dark mode
- src/ui/theme.py: Cleaned up get_global_qss function structure and removed redundant/duplicate CSS blocks
